{"v":4,"kind":"R","h":["2:32177","0.0","137.0",1954,"0.0",2],"ts":1109,"t":["Caption\n September is asking us to ground.\n\nGrounding isn't about the activity, it's about where you end up: back in your body, back in the present, back in a sense of safety.\n\nSo many of us live from the neck up, thinking and thinking because it feels like control. But that's often what leaves us feeling swirly and untethered.\n\nA long shower. Cooking without your phone. Feet on the earth. If it brings you back, it counts.\n\nSeptember Crystal Allies:\n\nBlack Tourmaline ~ grounding that protects\nSmoky Quartz ~ grounding that transforms\nRhodonite ~ grounding with compassion\nRed Jasper ~ grounding like a grandmother you love\nMontana Agate ~ grounding that balances","if I trusted myself, what would I do next?","what did I want before I started asking everyone else?","am I looking for clarity, or am I looking for permission?","what am I trying to \nconvince myself to want?","what answer am I hoping someone will talk me out of?","questions for recognizing your ~ yes ~ \nwhat did I want before I started asking everyone else?\nam I looking for clarity, or am I looking for permission?\nwhat am I trying to convince myself to want?\nwhat answer am I hoping someone will talk me out of?\nif I trusted myself, what would I do next?\n"],"s":["0|0|(page)"],"f":["Saol Display|Regular / Regular Italic|38","Trade Gothic LT Std|Regular|15","Saol Display|Regular Italic / Regular|38","Saol Display|Regular / Regular Italic|50","Saol Display|Regular|24","Saol Display|Regular Italic / Regular|50","Saol Display|Regular / Regular Italic|65","Saol Display|Regular / Regular Italic|24","Saol Display|Regular / Regular Italic|80","Saol Display|Regular|80","Trade Gothic LT Std|Regular|18","Saol Display|Regular / Regular Italic|60","Saol Display|Regular / Regular Italic|42","Saol Display|Regular Italic / Regular|42","Saol Display|Regular|30","Saol Display|Regular Italic / Regular|60","Saol Display|Regular / Regu